{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"feel\": \"开头突然涌起一阵强烈的心动和期待，兴奋里带着一点紧张；他很想靠近对方，却还不能把自己的动心当成对方已经回应。\",\n      \"why\": \"他想靠近的心意来得直接，已经认真到不能轻轻带过；但此刻能确定的只有自己确实被触动了，还不能确定对方是否也有同样的心意。因此，热切的期待已经成立，能否得到回应却仍然悬着。\",\n      \"op\": \"换候选\",\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"H\": [],\n        \"M\": [\n          \"M3\"\n        ],\n        \"orig\": [\n          1\n        ]\n      },\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"S01-B1\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"feel\": \"最初的激动渐渐退下一点，变成屏息等待；身体像刚踏上船板时短暂失重，还没有进入安稳的摇荡。\",\n      \"why\": \"最初的兴奋已经发生，却没有带来任何足以确认结果的东西。身体先警觉起来，注意力也先停住；等最初那一下过去，他才更清楚地意识到，自己正在等待这份想靠近的心意能否得到回应。因为对方的心意仍然未知，他还不能真正安心。\",\n      \"op\": \"说清已有因果\",\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"H\": [],\n        \"M\": [\n          \"M28\",\n          \"M21\"\n        ],\n        \"orig\": [\n          2\n        ]\n      },\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"S01-B1\",\n        \"S01-B3\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"feel\": \"像一句想了很久、很重要的话到了嘴边，先沉默几秒：不是不知道自己想说什么，而是这份心意已经很认真，却还不敢认定对方会怎样回应。\",\n      \"why\": \"他很清楚自己想靠近对方，也知道这份心意不能随便交出去；但自己的喜欢不能替对方决定心意。正因为想靠近的愿望很真切，而对方是否回应仍然未知，他才会一边想表达，一边谨慎地停住。\",\n      \"op\": \"说清已有因果\",\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"H\": [],\n        \"M\": [\n          \"M3\"\n        ],\n        \"orig\": [\n          3\n        ]\n      },\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"S01-B2\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": [\n    {\n      \"bead\": \"S01-B1\",\n      \"why\": \"“夏夜威尼斯的烟花”这一具体画面是听者的联想。现有候选能够解释突然涌起的激动、随后悬而未定的期待，却没有足够依据说明为什么恰好联想到威尼斯的夏夜，不宜进一步编造原因。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "66515cff-e454-4edc-8f25-667d525d4bb1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T184921028433Z", "elapsed_seconds": 264.281, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T18:53:45.325825+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "be36547c78d7da3c3d8663497dd4e77e3ca593c608eb537ea8228949323c0f54", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T184921028433Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "5b896691d3183cd76b9013e129fb7eec932164017213019fecdd85d1c3207d28"}}}
